### 5. Running the Application Locally

The project is structured with a modern React + Vite application:

```bash
# Install dependencies
npm.cmd install

# Run the development server
npm.cmd run dev

# Build production bundle
npm.cmd run build
```

The application runs locally at `http://localhost:5173/` with full interactive support for both Patient Kiosk Mode and Doctor OPD Console.
